{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117710","id":3429320400,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7MZ0bQ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117710","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117710.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117710.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117710","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117710/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117710/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117710/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/82f308d9571d87e6aac25d58630636cb159e6ae6","number":117710,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"LSP: Calculate simple string insertions on the server-side","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Requires and includes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114598\r\n\r\nSupersedes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/87508\r\n\r\nFixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/86488\r\nFixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-vscode-plugin/issues/961\r\nFixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-vscode-plugin/issues/885\r\nFixes https://github.com/GDQuest/zed-gdscript/issues/31\r\nDoes NOT fix - https://github.com/godotengine/godot-vscode-plugin/issues/644 -> can be solved using the same approach but will require an extra PR if this one goes through\r\n\r\nIf the language server only provides an `insertText` it is up to the client how this text is matched with existing code when inserting. The builtin editor does match quoted options with existing quotes, however external editors don't seem to generally do this.\r\n\r\nFor such cases the LSP allows servers to calculate the insertion on the server side. They only need to provide the client with the desired range where the text should be placed and clients have to follow this range without doing any matching.\r\n\r\nThis PR makes GDScript calculate the insertion of strings on the server side. It is not possible (or much more complex) to do this only in the LSP code, since it has very limited access to the AST. So instead this PR introduces the `TextEdit` concept into our own completion API and implements it directly in `gdscript_editor.cpp`.\r\n\r\nTODO:\r\n- [x] Use `_calculate_string_insertion` in all places that insert strings\r\n- [x] Fallback for old clients -> client capabilities (Nvmd: only `InsertReplaceEdit` is optional)\r\n- [x] Finalize internal representation on `ScriptLanguage::CodeCompletionOption`\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=",